  "details": "So, there is this issue that I need to bring up for Trust and Safety, it's the ability to 'Black-Hole' sets of Avatars as Toxic/Unwanted.  You all know what I mean, the Hitlers, the DBZ World Particles and then...   The Avatar Sound Spammers...   In this it would be nice to have a Unity option that prevents entry/change into said avatars and keep a \"Safe World, Safe\"\n\nIf not implemented system, then I would like to have a VRChat Log of the avatar change that my moderation team(s) then can warn a user or remove them  from the instance for non-compliance with the standards of the group.",
